# LLVM INT — Side ELF link and smoke commands

File: openOODA/audit/plan_llvm_int.oot
INT notes only. C emit + gcc remains the product path. Do not overwrite oodac/oodac.
Pin: v0.205.0-beta. Lane: LLVM emit only. COORD owns the gcc side rebuild.
This file is the command list. It is not a proof log.

Logline: After the side gcc compiler exists, emit-mods, clang-link oodac_llvm, wipe g_*, run the open68 smokes, and keep product check OK.
Setup: cwd is ooda/. Side gcc compiler is .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm. Product ./oodac/oodac and ./bin/ooda stay untouched.
Beats:
  1. Gate on the side gcc compiler. Do not start bootstrap/oodac_pure_build.
  2. emit-mods then clang-link to .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm.
  3. Wipe g_*. Run the .oo smokes with ./bin/ooda run. Product check still prints OK.

## 0. Law

  Do not overwrite `oodac/oodac`.
  Do not copy `bin/ooda` onto `oodac/oodac`.
  Do not run `bootstrap/oodac_pure_build` in this lane.
  Do not use `llvm-link`. clang takes the `.ll` files plus `runtime/chs_rt.c`.
  Cwd for every command below is `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda`.

## 1. Gate (after COORD)

    test -x .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm
    test -x ./bin/ooda
    test -x ./oodac/oodac
    ./oodac/oodac check fixtures/hello.oo
    # must print OK now, before emit-mods

  `oodac_gcc_llvm` is a gcc-built compiler (C path) with the LLVM emit source.
  `emit-mods` re-spawns `$OODAC_BIN --backend llvm emit-llvm` per module
  (`oodac/cli_emit.oo`). Set both env names to the side compiler or the
  child uses `./oodac/oodac`.

## 2. emit-mods

  Real argv is `emit-mods <file> <outdir>` (`oodac/main.oo`, `cli_parse.oo`).
  Same drive as `scripts/open68_link_smoke.oo`.

    rm -rf .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    mkdir -p .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    OODAC_BIN=.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
    OODA_COMPILER=.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
      .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
      emit-mods oodac/main.oo .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    # expect: OK	emit-mods	.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    test -s .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods/list.txt
    test $(find .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods -name '*.ll' | wc -l) -gt 1

## 3. clang-link (no llvm-link)

  Real flags from `scripts/open68_link_smoke.oo` (`mods` there is
  `.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods`).

    clang -O0 -Wno-override-module -Iruntime \
      .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods/*.ll \
      runtime/chs_rt.c -lm -ldl -lpthread \
      -o .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm
    test -x .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm
    grep -a -q 'oodac: usage:' .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm
    ! grep -a -q 'pure .oo product CLI' .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm

  Do not write that ELF onto `oodac/oodac`.

## 4. Wipe g_*

  Tree keys live under `.ooda-cache/check` and start with `g_`
  (`oodac/check_cache.oo`). Cold smokes wipe this set.

    mkdir -p .ooda-cache/check
    rm -f .ooda-cache/check/g_*
    ! ls .ooda-cache/check/g_* >/dev/null 2>&1

## 5. How open68 smokes are invoked (repo fact)

  No e2e or CI line execs `scripts/open68_*_smoke.oo`.
  `scripts/ci_product_rails.oo` only `oodac check`s `open68_llvm_lock.oo`.
  Every open68 smoke is a `pub fn main` `.oo` with Setup: cwd is ooda/.
  Product exec of that class is `./bin/ooda run` (AGENTS.oot;
  `audit/plan_sk1.oot`: `timeout 30 ./bin/ooda run scripts/lsp_complete_smoke.oo`;
  `audit/wasm_sec.oot`: `./bin/ooda run scripts/wasm_fail_closed_smoke.oo`).
  Some INT notes use `./scripts/` (`audit/plan1_int.oot`). Same file.
  Compiler `run` exists (`oodac/main.oo`): check + emit-c + gcc + exec.
  `scripts/install_xdg_smoke.oo` uses `./oodac/oodac run`. Prefer CLI.

  Prefer:

    ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_cold_hello_smoke.oo

  That is the same invocation `open68_stamp_smoke.oo` needs:

    ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_stamp_smoke.oo

  Stamp smoke wants `.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_stamp`, not `oodac_llvm`.
  It may plant via `oodac_stamp_gcc`. Cold hello must not plant.
  Fallback if `./bin/ooda` is missing:

    ./oodac/oodac run scripts/open68_cold_hello_smoke.oo

## 6. Run list (after oodac_llvm exists)

  Phase 1 (prefer this first):

    timeout 240 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_cold_hello_smoke.oo
    # want: open68_cold_hello_smoke: PASSED

  Phase 2:

    timeout 360 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_main_check_smoke.oo
    # want: open68_main_check_smoke: PASSED

  Phase 3:

    timeout 720 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_cmds_floor_smoke.oo
    # want: open68_cmds_floor_smoke: PASSED

  Emit lock (drives product `./oodac/oodac --backend llvm emit-llvm`,
  not the LLVM ELF):

    timeout 120 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_match_expr_smoke.oo
    # want: open68_match_expr_smoke: PASSED

  Hostile / plant (same `./bin/ooda run` class):

    timeout 180 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_pv1_hostile.oo
    timeout 180 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_pv2_plant.oo

  Optional old lock (needs `oodac_stamp`; skip if that ELF is absent):

    timeout 120 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_stamp_smoke.oo

  If a mutate smoke dies, restore hello from its bak:

    cp .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68_cold/hello.bak fixtures/hello.oo
    cp .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68_pv1/hello.bak fixtures/hello.oo
    cp .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/hello_stamp.bak fixtures/hello.oo

## 7. Product must still print OK

    ./oodac/oodac check fixtures/hello.oo
    # must print OK
    test -x ./oodac/oodac
    grep -a -q 'oodac: usage:' ./oodac/oodac
    ! grep -a -q 'pure .oo product CLI' ./oodac/oodac

  That binary is the C-path product compiler. Leave it in place.

## 8. Copy-paste block

    cd /home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda
    test -x .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm
    ./oodac/oodac check fixtures/hello.oo
    rm -rf .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    mkdir -p .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    OODAC_BIN=.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
    OODA_COMPILER=.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
      .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_gcc_llvm \
      emit-mods oodac/main.oo .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods
    clang -O0 -Wno-override-module -Iruntime \
      .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/open68-mods/*.ll \
      runtime/chs_rt.c -lm -ldl -lpthread \
      -o .ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_llvm
    mkdir -p .ooda-cache/check
    rm -f .ooda-cache/check/g_*
    timeout 240 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_cold_hello_smoke.oo
    timeout 360 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_main_check_smoke.oo
    timeout 720 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_cmds_floor_smoke.oo
    timeout 120 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_match_expr_smoke.oo
    timeout 180 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_pv1_hostile.oo
    timeout 180 ./bin/ooda run scripts/open68_pv2_plant.oo
    ./oodac/oodac check fixtures/hello.oo

C emit plus gcc remains the product path.
